STRING 6870
{
Changes
}

STRING 6871
{
==========CHANGES==========
- Starting Rerolls: 4->5
- Samwise: Now always has the same health and damage and doesn't scale
- Samwise: Reverted the change that allowed more than 1 Samwise to spawn, as the introduction of this was when it began sometimes crashing when Samwise spawned. It's important you report any Samwise spawn crashes you see after this change.
- Enemy scaling: Health scaling increased by 8.33%, extra scaling after 10 minutes increased by 20%, extra scaling after 15 minutes further increased to bring the game to a swift end
- Firebreather: Now attacks in a clockwise pattern instead of a counterclockwise pattern
- Flamecaster: Now appears on opposite sides when multiple instances are purchased, no longer considered Splash damage
- Soulstealer: Now grants +20 Mana Shield instead of +10 Max HP
- Death Generator: Damage 400->200, attack cooldown 1.0->0.334, permanent damage bonus on hit removed, now does +10% damage for every Death Generator purchased after the first
- Power Generator, Scrolls, Wisp etc: No longer stack after 15 minutes
- Magic Treasure: Gold value 500->250, Gold value increase per second 1->2, Bounty scaling 50%->100%
}

