STRING 7736
{
Balance Changes
}

STRING 7737
{
==========NERFS==========
- Thorn: Normal damage vulnerability per hit 10%->5%
- Steam Cannon: Siege damage vulnerability per hit 10%->5%
- Frost Bomb: Bomb explosion damage 900->600
- Death Coil: Chaos damage vulnerability per hit 20%->10%
- Necrotic Tome: Skeletal Mage duration attack speed scaling 200%->100%
==========BUFFS==========
- Firebreather: Damage 250->400, DPS 125->200, now benefits from +% Attack Speed
- Manastone: Now benefits from +% Attack Speed
- Icebreather: Now benefits from +% Attack Speed
- Healing Sprayer: Damage 50->100, attack cooldown 0.33->0.5, healing per target hit 2->4, DPS 150->200
- Bombs: Damage 200->250, DPS 200->250
- Cluster Rockets: Now benefits from +% Attack Speed, increasing the damage directly due to how the weapon works
- Healthstone: Now benefits from +% Attack Speed
- Chaos Web: Damage 375->450, DPS 125->150
- Immolation: Now benefits from +% Attack Speed
- Combustion: Bonus explosion damage 250%->500%
- Blight Aura: Now deals +10% additive damage for each Poison on the enemy
}

